                        "glosses": [
                            "Of, relating to or characteristic of the Kardashian family."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0349cba9-b713-468b-bc67-560265fedbd0",
                                "sense_id": "221029d3-db15-32b2-a791-6998972acfaa",
                                "text": "“Too sexy,” GoGo said. “Take it off.” A one-shoulder, purple chiffon dress from Jillian. “Too Kardashian,” Lauren said. “She’s so yesterday.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5835c183-d8c2-4f60-9c1a-5d183986f36f",
                                "sense_id": "221029d3-db15-32b2-a791-6998972acfaa",
                                "text": "It’s certainly the most considered with its careful tumble of microgreens and insistence of using blue crab instead of something more Kardashian."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "425fa091-3f7e-45ec-9a53-ee65fd320943",
                                "sense_id": "221029d3-db15-32b2-a791-6998972acfaa",
                                "text": "I always thought that was a pinch too Kardashian of you but I’m not here to judge"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b91e1e00-d82e-4a25-bbf7-27541558860d",
                                "sense_id": "221029d3-db15-32b2-a791-6998972acfaa",
                                "text": "But now, you can actually charter private jets to transport your dog in style. Yes, it all sounds very Kardashian, and is substantially more expensive than regular air travel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b662437c-6803-476a-ade9-b748da932da3",
                                "sense_id": "221029d3-db15-32b2-a791-6998972acfaa",
                                "text": "It’s all very Kardashian."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
